## 📊 Executive Summary

The X-Ray integration for the Procedure Picker Engine (PPE) has been successfully completed and tested. The system now supports **18 body regions**, **40 view options**, and includes advanced search intelligence that understands natural language queries.

**Key Achievement:** Users can now find X-Ray procedures in seconds using intuitive searches like "chest xray 2 view" or "c-spine 4v" instead of navigating multiple menus.

---

## ✅ What Was Delivered

### 1. Data Foundation (procedures-global.js)
✅ **18 X-Ray Body Regions** fully integrated:
- Spine regions (3): Cervical, Thoracic, Lumbar
- Torso regions (4): Chest, Abdomen, Ribs, Pelvis
- Lower extremities (6): Hip, Femur, Knee, Tibia, Ankle, Foot
- Upper extremities (5): Shoulder, Clavicle, Elbow, Hand, Wrist

✅ **40 View Options** with accurate CPT codes
✅ **Most Common badges** for frequently used procedures
✅ **Auto-resolve flags** for single-view regions

### 2. Search Engine Intelligence (search-engine.ts)
✅ **Natural language understanding**
- "chest xray 2 view" → CPT 71046
- "c-spine 4v" → CPT 72050
- "lumbar flexion" → CPT 72114

✅ **60+ view token variations recognized**
- 1v, 2view, 3-view, 4v, etc.
- flexion, extension, lordotic, oblique

✅ **70+ region synonym mappings**
- c-spine → cervicalSpine
- l-spine → lumbarSpine
- low back → lumbarSpine

✅ **Smart modality inference**
- Detects X-Ray from region names
- No need to type "xray" every time

### 3. View Selection Renderer (xray-view-renderer.ts)
✅ **Clean, intuitive UI** for view options
✅ **Most Common badges** for popular choices
✅ **Auto-resolve detection** for single-view regions
✅ **Professional visual design** matching existing modalities

### 4. Modal Controller Integration (modal-controller.ts)
✅ **Seamless X-Ray workflow** integration
✅ **Auto-resolve handling** for Clavicle, Femur, Tibia
✅ **Region key mapping** with camelCase support
✅ **Smart navigation** between screens

### 5. Region Renderer Enhancement (region-renderer.ts)
✅ **18 X-Ray regions** with proper icons
✅ **Organized by category** (Spine, Torso, Extremities)
✅ **Responsive grid layout**
✅ **Visual consistency** with MRI/CT

### 6. Modality Detector Updates (modality-detector.ts)
✅ **All X-Ray aliases** supported:
- xray, x-ray, x ray
- radiograph, xra

✅ **Contrast configuration** (X-Ray has no contrast)
✅ **Proper routing** to X-Ray flow

